===================


 * list clusters with: kops get cluster
 * edit this cluster with: kops edit cluster rama.k8s.local
 * edit your node instance group: kops edit ig --name=rama.k8s.local nodes-us-east-1a
 * edit your control-plane instance group: kops edit ig --name=rama.k8s.local control-plane-us-east-1a

